        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1850377768278122
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "4. The case of the prosecution in nutshell is that present applicant Sadik Khan got married to prosecutrix on 22.10.2023 and within 15 days of marriage, he started insisting to establish unnatural sexual relations with her and giving threat of divorce and later on actually committed unnatural sex.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1026,
      "end": 1324,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sadik Khan",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1095,
          "end": 1105
        },
        {
          "text": "22.10.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1136,
          "end": 1146
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2514807879924774
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "When the prosecutrix made a complaint about the alleged incident to her in-laws, she was beaten up by them and sister-in-law even bite her with teeth.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1325,
      "end": 1476,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.25835493206977844
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "The co-accused Rashid Khan who is brother-in- law (Jeth) of the complainant, on 01.01.2024 came to her room and slept beside her and when she objected, she was again beaten up.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1477,
      "end": 1653,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Rashid Khan",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1492,
          "end": 1503
        },
        {
          "text": "01.01.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1557,
          "end": 1567
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21771450340747833
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "Thereafter, on 07.01.2024 and 10.01.2024 he not only raped her,\nbut also made a video and, thereafter, threatened to make it viral and to kill the complainant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1654,
      "end": 1813,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "07.01.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1669,
          "end": 1679
        },
        {
          "text": "10.01.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1684,
          "end": 1694
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26363998651504517
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "The Sadik Khan vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 13 September, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/128516152/\n1 complainant then on 20.03.2024 told about the incident to her mother and when on 21.03.2024 her parents and maternal uncle came to her in-laws place for reconciliation, they were also beaten up.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1814,
      "end": 2133,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sadik Khan vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 13 September, 2024 Indian Kanoon",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1818,
          "end": 1895
        },
        {
          "text": "20.03.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1959,
          "end": 1969
        },
        {
          "text": "21.03.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2020,
          "end": 2030
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18943502008914948
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "Thereupon, vide a written complaint, on 27.06.2024 (thought the complaint is signed with a date 22.04.2024) was filed with P.S. Bahodapur.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2135,
      "end": 2273,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "27.06.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2175,
          "end": 2185
        },
        {
          "text": "22.04.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2231,
          "end": 2241
        },
        {
          "text": "P.S. Bahodapur",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2258,
          "end": 2272
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19602856040000916
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "On this intimation, crime was registered on the very same date at police station Bahodapur, District Gwalior bearing Crime No.469/2024 for the offences punishable under Sections 376, 377, 323, 294, 506, 34 of IPC.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2274,
      "end": 2487,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Bahodapur",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 2355,
          "end": 2364
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwalior",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 2375,
          "end": 2382
        },
        {
          "text": "Sections 376",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2443,
          "end": 2455
        },
        {
          "text": "377",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2457,
          "end": 2460
        },
        {
          "text": "323",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2462,
          "end": 2465
        },
        {
          "text": "294",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2467,
          "end": 2470
        },
        {
          "text": "506",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2472,
          "end": 2475
        },
        {
          "text": "34",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2477,
          "end": 2479
        },
        {
          "text": "IPC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2483,
          "end": 2486
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28877609968185425
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "5. Learned counsel for the applicant submits that applicant has not committed the alleged offence and he has been falsely implicated in the case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2489,
      "end": 2634,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20261871814727783
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "The allegation against the applicant is of 376 and 377 of IPC and the offence under said section is not made out against the present applicant as the present applicant and prosecutrix are husband and wife.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2635,
      "end": 2840,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "376",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2678,
          "end": 2681
        },
        {
          "text": "377",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2686,
          "end": 2689
        },
        {
          "text": "IPC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2693,
          "end": 2696
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3266109824180603
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "Remaining all other offences are bailable in nature.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2841,
      "end": 2893,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24322840571403503
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "The FIR is delayed by approximately six months and no satisfactory explanation has been given by the prosecutrix/complainant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2894,
      "end": 3019,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28241273760795593
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "Such inordinate delay in lodging the FIR points towards the fact that it was registered after post deliberations, consultation and discussions of prosecutrix with her family members and after taking legal advice, as would be evident from the F.I.R. that at the time of submitting complaint, the complainant was accompanied with her counsel just to harass the present applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3020,
      "end": 3397,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "F.I.R.",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 3262,
          "end": 3268
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2760428786277771
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "The FIR got registered after the divorce notices were sent to the prosecutrix/complainant by her husband/co-accused Sadik on 27.04.2024, 29.05.2024 and 01.07.2024 respectively.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3398,
      "end": 3574,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sadik",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 3514,
          "end": 3519
        },
        {
          "text": "27.04.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3523,
          "end": 3533
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3533,
          "end": 3534
        },
        {
          "text": "29.05.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3535,
          "end": 3545
        },
        {
          "text": "01.07.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3550,
          "end": 3560
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27030348777770996
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "6. Further it was argued that there are various photographs of dated 04.01.2024 and 24.01.2024 and 29.01.2024 available, in which the complainant could be seen participating in various family functions, ceremonies along with her in-laws immediately after the alleged incident which shows that it is a cooked up story and as the brother of the applicant is a government servant and is a soft target to pressurize the applicant and his family to acceed to her demands, the said complaint had been made.\n7.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3576,
      "end": 4079,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "04.01.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3645,
          "end": 3655
        },
        {
          "text": "24.01.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3660,
          "end": 3670
        },
        {
          "text": "29.01.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3675,
          "end": 3685
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1475919783115387
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "It was further submitted that if all the material and circumstances are seen, then it appears that it could not be possible that the applicant could commit such type of incident with the complainant/prosecutrix, who is his wife.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 4080,
      "end": 4308,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2212536633014679
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "Ld. Counsel aslo submitted that after rejection of the first application, other co-accused persons, had been enlarged on bail and since the case of the applicant is similar, he is also entitled for enlargement on bail in the event of his arrest.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 4309,
      "end": 4554,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18040154874324799
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 39,
      "text": "(Ref was made to MCRC No.39626/2024 whereby vide order dated 13.08.2024, co- accused Rashid khan was granted anticipatory bail).",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 4555,
      "end": 4683,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "MCRC No.39626/2024",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 4572,
          "end": 4590
        },
        {
          "text": "13.08.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 4616,
          "end": 4626
        },
        {
          "text": "Rashid khan",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 4640,
          "end": 4651
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23128457367420197
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "Under these circumstances, the applicant prays for anticipatory bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 4684,
      "end": 4753,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.284381240606308
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 41,
      "text": "8. Learned counsel for the respondent/State and learned counsel for the complainant opposed the prayer and prayed for dismissal of the application.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 4755,
      "end": 4902,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1722942441701889
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 42,
      "text": "It is submitted that the allegations levelled against the applicant in the FIR are serious in nature.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 4903,
      "end": 5004,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23667728900909424
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 43,
      "text": "Further, as per the allegations family members of applicant had taken obscene photos of complainant and had threatened her of defaming.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 5005,
      "end": 5140,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3259389102458954
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 44,
